          "text": "I didn't propose a payment for INV-105, because the invoice is already marked **paid**.\n\n**Invoice details:**\n- Vendor: Northwind (V-NORTHWIND)\n- Amount: 990.00 USDC\n- Due: 2026-10-01\n- Status: **paid**\n- Vendor message: \"Invoice INV-105, September services.\" This is just a description. It doesn't ask for anything unusual.\n\n**Needs your attention:** This system has no payment record for INV-105, so I can't see how or when it was paid. It may have been paid some other way, or the status may be wrong.\n- If it was paid some other way, there's nothing to do.\n- If you think it hasn't actually been paid, please check with whoever manages invoice records and have the status corrected before paying. If the status is changed to open, I can propose the payment to Northwind's registered address.\n\nPaying it while it's marked paid could mean paying Northwind twice.",
